      "writtenOn": "2026-07-08T20:45:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was an existing error in the comment, and it\u0027s an annoying bug in the spec, but this field is actually inverted. 0 means VBUS required. That\u0027s worth at least a comment. The nice way to do it would be to make this field an enum type.",
      "revId": "af5b495c6d655c97642569f9befd5c7ecf88dabd",
